    <http://data.europa.eu/a4g/resource/a9e42bfd-2cca-4385-9453-6d9ef3f500ae-01/GreenProcurement$_ContractAwardNotice1_ProcurementProjectLot1_TenderingTerms1_UBLExtensions1_UBLExtension1_ExtensionContent1_EformsExtension1_StrategicProcurement1>,
